      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_trade_03_00",
      "hash64": "82AA4426D043F424",
      "text": "要是同行宝可梦\\n只有１只可没法交换啊。\\r\\n拜托你带着２只以上再来找我啦。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
