      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_trade_03_01",
      "hash64": "82AA4526D043F5D7",
      "text": "哦？不交换了吗？\\n要是你下定决心就再来找我吧！[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
