      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_battleend_lose_00_00",
      "hash64": "E3B8F1400D3B35B6",
      "text": "哦哦！撞大运打赢你了！\\n这就是所谓的“猴怪也会摔下树”吗？[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
